  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing dialogue about the need for safety, efficiency, and compliance. However, I must emphasize that sustainability should not be compromised. While I can support a slight extension in processing times (EFF-01), I propose that we also consider how this impacts energy consumption (GRN-01) and overall resource efficiency (GRN-04). To harmonize our goals, I suggest we define thresholds for processing times that are energy-efficient and do not exceed necessary limits, thus ensuring both performance and sustainability. Additionally, I believe we can maintain separate audit trail focuses (TRU-03 and RES-03) while still aligning their implementations to minimize resource impact.",
